										Join EverQuote for a live question and answer session with multiple award-winning agent – <b>John Pavle</b> on <b>Thursday, April 2nd, 2020 @ 2:00 PM Eastern.</b> EverQuote’s General Manager of Agency, Nick Graham, will be hosting Mr. Pavle for a discussion of some of the business strategies he is employing at his agencies during this difficult time. The discussion will focus on topics ranging from:
<br>
<ul>
<li>Strategies for the rest of 2020 and dealing with changing circumstances</li>
<li>Working remotely & managing your staff</li>
<li>Maintaining customer relationships in a challenging time</li>
<li>His approach to working leads</li>
<li>Measuring the impact of lead sources</li>
<li>Insurance agency marketing in a “post-quarantine” business landscape</li>
</ul>
This is a “can’t miss” interview style webinar where you’ll have the opportunity to learn the best practives used by a very successful agent. You can <a href="https://zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_k6HiGjvsQ5miyeVzyY8vUg">sign-up for the free webinar here directly through our link!</a>
